//   Logos doesn't blanket-derive Clone for fixed arrays, and the
//   slice iter is the canonical entry into the iter pipeline.
// - `.collect()` resolves via CP-cm-14 to `Vec<i32>::from_iter<…>`.
// - `&v[..]` slice-of-vec equality check unrolled to per-index
//   assert_eq!.
